@startuml fig2i-ui-2
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.iuml
title Figure 2i (revises part of 2.2 Figure 2): C1 UI Views, part 2: tab fragments, adapters and helpers (all fragments extend BaseFragment and implement Refreshable)

package "C1 UI Views: com.team04.splitsmart.ui" {
  class UiUtils <<new>> {
    +{static} applySystemBarInsets(root) / bindAvatar(avatar, user) : void
    +{static} titleOf(transaction) / typeLabel(transaction) : String
    +{static} nameOf(users, uid, currentUid) : String
    +{static} iconFor(category) / colorFor(category) : int
    <b>+{static} submitKeepingTop(adapter, list, items) : void (new)</b>
  }
  abstract class BaseFragment <<new>> {
    #obtainViewModel(type) : T
    #obtainActivityViewModel(type) : T
    #showMessage(message) / observeMessages(viewModel)
  }
  interface Refreshable <<interface>> <<new>> {
    +refresh() : void
  }
  class SimpleTextWatcher <<new>> {
    implements TextWatcher
    +SimpleTextWatcher(listener : OnTextChanged)
    +afterTextChanged(s : Editable) : void
  }
  class HistoryFragment {
    {field} <b>-typeGroup, categoryChip, memberChip, sortChip (chips, was Spinners) (changed)</b>
    {field} <b>-matchCaseChip : Chip (checkable "Match case", R13) (new)</b>
    -adapter : TransactionAdapter
    {field} <b>-list : RecyclerView (new)</b>
    -viewModel : HistoryViewModel
    <b>+refresh() : void (new)</b>
    <b>-renderList(transactions) / renderQuery(query) (changed)</b>
  }
  class BalanceFragment {
    -viewModel : BalanceViewModel
    <b>+refresh() : void (new)</b>
    -render(summary : BalanceSummary)
    <b>-bindRow(row, pair : PairBalance) (R9) (new)</b>
    <b>-shareBalances() : void (new)</b>
  }
  class SummaryFragment {
    -viewModel : SummaryViewModel
    <b>+refresh() : void (new)</b>
    -render(summary : MonthlySummary)
    <b>-showMonthPicker() (was onMonthSelected)</b>
  }
  class MembersFragment <<new>> {
    {field} -viewModel : GroupViewModel (shared with the activity)
    +refresh() : void
    -addMember() : void
    -renderMembers(members : List<User>)
    -showMemberOptions(member : User)
  }
  class GroupAdapter <<new>> {
    extends ListAdapter<GroupListItem, GroupAdapter.Holder>
  }
  class TransactionAdapter <<new>> {
    extends ListAdapter<Transaction, TransactionAdapter.Holder>
    +setUsers(users : Map<String, User>) : void
  }
  note left of UiUtils
    submitKeepingTop: a list that was at its top
    stays there after an update, so a new row
    inserted above the visible area is seen.
    Used by GroupListActivity and HistoryFragment.
  end note
  note bottom of BalanceFragment
    bindRow: the row button shows only if
    pair.currentUserOwes() || pair.owesCurrentUser().
    "Settle up" (you owe) and "Record payment"
    (they owe you) open SettlementFormActivity's
    newCreateIntent and newReceivedIntent (R9).
  end note
}

UiUtils -[hidden]right- BaseFragment
BaseFragment -[hidden]right- Refreshable
Refreshable -[hidden]right- SimpleTextWatcher
BaseFragment <|-- HistoryFragment
BaseFragment <|-- BalanceFragment
BaseFragment <|-- SummaryFragment
HistoryFragment -[hidden]- MembersFragment
BalanceFragment -[hidden]- GroupAdapter
SummaryFragment -[hidden]- TransactionAdapter

legend bottom left
<b>Bold</b> = new or changed since Project 2.2 (changed members say what they were); <s><color:#888888>struck through</color></s> = removed; plain = unchanged; «new» = class added since Project 2.2; <u>underlined</u> = static.
Every fragment extends BaseFragment and implements Refreshable.
endlegend
@enduml
